{
  "id": "goody-hao",
  "version": "0.4.9",
  "tier": "official",
  "displayName": "GoodyHao",
  "description": "内置工程原则随会话注入:贡献 systemPrompts 槽,由壳在内核支持「追加系统 prompt」时注入其 system prompt。卸载即停止注入。",
